  "implementation_notes": [
    "Rules are condition families, not coordinate-specific placements.",
    "A real placement pass should evaluate rules by priority: guards -> tiny/island/protrusion -> contextual edges -> generic edges -> mid/deep.",
    "Large clusters must be rejected when sprite bounds cross road, ruin, water, route, or canvas exclusion masks.",
    "The current sample has many edge/front/back/side cases and enough corner/protrusion cases to justify dedicated edge assets."
  ]
